### Design Dashboard API — sample requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:100

### 1) Active customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer

### 2) Designs by customer + date range (use an account that has bills)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/designs?customerAccountId=1686&startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

### 3) Design detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/design/6634?customerAccountId=1686&startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

### 4) Dashboard summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary?customerAccountId=1686&startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

### 5) Dashboard charts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/charts?customerAccountId=1686&startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
